# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare Worker — tg-storage-worker
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Set SECRETS via:  npx wrangler secret put <NAME>
# (These are encrypted and NEVER appear in wrangler.toml or source code.)
#
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=   (from @BotFather)
# TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID=  (e.g. -100XXXXXXXXXX — your private storage channel)
# JWT_SECRET=           (MUST match JWT_SECRET in your Render backend .env)
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set VARS in wrangler.toml [vars] section (non-sensitive):
#
# RENDER_BACKEND_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com
# WORKER_KEY=same_value_as_backend_WORKER_KEY
